---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="About" description="About Nour Gaser Algendi, projects, hobbies, and professional goals.">
  <main class="about-page" data-ngx-section="about" data-ngx-label="About Me" data-ngx-focusable="true" data-ngx-route="/about">
    <section class="about-hero" data-ngx-section="about-intro" data-ngx-label="About Intro">
      <div class="about-hero-inner">
        <div class="about-hero-copy">
          <p class="about-kicker">About me</p>
          <p class="about-intro-text">
            Why anyone would be interested in reading about me is beyond me... Unless you're a potential employer in
            which case I implore you to continue.
          </p>
          <a class="about-cta" href="#business-and-profession">Straight to business</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" data-ngx-section="who-am-i" data-ngx-label="Who Am I" data-ngx-focusable="true">
      <div class="about-section-inner">
        <h2>Who am I?</h2>
        <div class="about-box about-box--who">
          <div class="about-box-content">
            <p>
              As much as I disagree with (and don't think it possible) defining anyone with only a few lines of text,
              I'll try my best. My name is Nour Gaser Algendi, I was born in 2001 in Egypt, and that's as much as I'm
              willing to leave online. I'm a nerdy (duh), science enthusiast that wears his love for science (all STEM
              fields) and science fiction in proudness. I'm overly critical of people's judgement and their acceptance
              of knowledge, I always require sources for information, and I'm opinionated and argumentative when it comes
              to certain topics (don't get me started on horoscopes and all of the bogus personality tests).
            </p>
            <p>
              It's worth mentioning that I am against the trendy opinion of the critisim of traditional education and
              academics, I believe in education (as a right and as a choice). Reading Google's top search results and 3
              lines from a wikipedia page, or copying code from stackoverflow, is not knowledge or science; our world is
              barely stitched together by half-assed jobs done to their minimum quality by people who wanted to (and
              could only) just get the job done. Employees which have no education and have only one practical skill
              learned by doing are capitalists' dreams, not the world's or the advancement of science's. My GPA as a
              junior bachelor in computer science is 3.9 as of fall 2022.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-box-media" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      class="about-section"
      data-ngx-section="productivity-and-projects"
      data-ngx-label="Productivity and Projects"
      data-ngx-focusable="true"
    >
      <div class="about-section-inner">
        <h2>Productivity and Projects</h2>
        <div class="about-box about-box--productivity">
          <div class="about-box-media" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="about-box-content">
            <p>
              Aside from professional projects (which there are very little of as of right now), my personal projects
              are mostly all nerdy, useless (I'll argue against that till the morning, but there's a general consensus
              from my obviously wrong circle of friends/family) ideas which no one cares about aside from me. These
              range from weird electronics/digital logic/arduino project ideas which I fail to put together, to web-dev
              and CLI project ideas which are hard to explain, expensive to host, hard to implement, and no one would
              use but me, like this very website's own engine, ngxos.
            </p>
            <p>
              I also create random apps and websites here and there to learn new technologies; these range from
              react-native mobile apps, outdatted java jframes and c++ qt desktop apps, video games with unity, and
              various websites' frontends and backends using a wide range of technologies (but mostly MERN stack); I'll
              refer you to my skills and experiences page for more details about that. There's a few more small
              projects, but that's honestly all that comes to mind.
            </p>
            <p>
              For my current proejcts, there's a few but the most notable are a skill-list generator app (using ml and
              online vcs hosting websites' APIs), and a turn-based fighting game which combines elements from Xcoms's
              perfect RNG system (in my opinion), League of Legends' rich character abilities and lore and surprising
              keystone synnergies, and Hearthstone's card collection system.
            </p>
            <p>
              One more thing, don't get fooled by my personal website's nerdy design, this is my personal preference
              (I'd throw my mouse from the window and use only my keyboard if I could), and it's a change of scenery
              from all of the material design that I do to follow the current web-dev market standards (again, I refer
              you to the link above).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" data-ngx-section="hobbies" data-ngx-label="Hobbies" data-ngx-focusable="true">
      <div class="about-section-inner">
        <h2>Hobbies</h2>
        <div class="about-box about-box--hobbies">
          <div class="about-box-content">
            <p>
              My interests are mostly centered around game design and development, reading and writing, and long-form
              learning. I care a lot about disciplined study, meaningful creative work, and building systems that are
              both expressive and useful. I am also actively moving toward digital minimalism and a more intentional
              way of living, guided by my faith and values.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-box-media" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section
      id="business-and-profession"
      class="about-section"
      data-ngx-section="business-and-profession"
      data-ngx-label="Business and Profession"
      data-ngx-focusable="true"
    >
      <div class="about-section-inner">
        <h2>Business and Profession</h2>
        <div class="about-box about-box--business">
          <div class="about-box-media" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="about-box-content">
            <p>
              If you're here for professional work, consultancy, or collaboration, head to the dedicated business page
              for current experience, expertise, and contact points.
            </p>
            <p class="about-business-links">
              <a href="/business">Open business profile</a>
              <a href="/skills">View skills</a>
              <a href="/resume">Resume</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    background: #03070f;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .about-hero,
  .about-section {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-hero {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    min-height: 390px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(3, 8, 17, 0.3), rgba(3, 8, 17, 0.55)),
      url('/about/man_on_planet.png') center center / cover no-repeat;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(101, 152, 210, 0.38);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(101, 152, 210, 0.38);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-hero-inner,
  .about-section-inner {
    width: min(1240px, calc(100% - (var(--space-8) * 2)));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-hero-inner {
    padding: var(--space-8) 0;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: min(560px, 100%);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .about-hero-copy::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 100vw;
    top: -22px;
    bottom: -22px;
    background: rgba(8, 13, 23, 0.42);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(101, 152, 210, 0.26);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(101, 152, 210, 0.26);
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-kicker {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-xl), 3.3vw, 2.1rem);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
  }

  .about-intro-text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-base), 2vw, var(--text-xl));
    max-width: 36ch;
  }

  .about-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    display: inline-block;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    background: #2d5f92;
    border: 1px solid #4a7fb8;
    color: #e8f0ff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .about-cta:hover {
    background: #366ca3;
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    font-size: clamp(var(--text-xl), 3vw, 2.2rem);
  }

  .about-box {
    background: rgba(8, 12, 22, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(100, 157, 226, 0.6);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    overflow: hidden;
    align-items: stretch;
    min-height: 96px;
  }

  .about-box-content {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .about-box-media {
    background-size: cover;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(100, 157, 226, 0.55);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .about-box--who .about-box-media {
    width: 102px;
    background-image: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.15), rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.95)), url('/about/cave.png');
    background-position: right center;
    background-size: cover;
  }

  .about-box--productivity {
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-box--productivity .about-box-media {
    order: -1;
    width: 256px;
    border-left: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(100, 157, 226, 0.55);
    background-color: rgba(2, 8, 20, 0.55);
    background-size: 92% auto;
    background-position: center center;
    background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.15), rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.78)), url('/about/brain.png');
  }

  .about-box--hobbies .about-box-media {
    width: 236px;
    background-image: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.1), rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.9)), url('/about/space_spaceship.png');
    background-position: right center;
    background-size: cover;
  }

  .about-box--business .about-box-media {
    order: -1;
    width: 216px;
    border-left: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(100, 157, 226, 0.55);
    background-image: linear-gradient(to left, rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.2), rgba(4, 8, 16, 0.94)), url('/about/space.png');
    background-position: left center;
    background-size: cover;
  }

  .about-box p {
    margin: 0;
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-primary) 92%, transparent);
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .about-box p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-business-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-business-links a {
    color: var(--text-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-accent) 32%, transparent);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-page { padding-bottom: var(--space-10); }

    .about-hero-inner,
    .about-section-inner {
      width: min(100% - (var(--space-4) * 2), 1240px);
    }

    .about-hero {
      margin-top: var(--space-4);
      min-height: 280px;
      background-position: 62% center;
    }

    .about-hero-copy {
      width: min(440px, 100%);
    }

    .about-hero-copy::before {
      top: -16px;
      bottom: -16px;
    }

    .about-kicker {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }

    .about-intro-text {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
    }

    .about-section {
      margin-top: var(--space-6);
    }

    .about-section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(var(--text-lg), 6vw, var(--text-xl));
    }

    .about-box {
      display: block;
      padding: var(--space-3);
    }

    .about-box-media {
      width: 100% !important;
      min-height: 120px;
      margin-top: var(--space-3);
      border-left: 0;
      border-right: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(100, 157, 226, 0.55);
    }

    .about-box--productivity .about-box-media {
      order: initial;
    }

    .about-box--business .about-box-media {
      order: initial;
      border-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
